      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RAMIREZ MONELLI (4) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a 4 length win at this track in a handy 27.83. Awkwardly drawn but has a good record over this journey. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Looks to have an edge on most of these. ALFRED KEEPING (7) recorded a 2 length win (22.77) in a Novice race last time at this track. Can feature with the right run. GO BOY (2) missed the frame latest when fifth at this track (27.99) but scored three back at this track (22.84). Can do much better this time. SCARLETT'S BOY (1) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back.",
